"%
; VCarve Pro post — Laguna Swift 5×10 (laguna-swift-5x10)
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; UNVERIFIED G-CODE — verify every line against your Mach3/Mach4 setup before
; running on the machine. Output is not guaranteed safe for any real machine.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Wood routing checklist:
; [1] Material clamped flat to spoilboard, no warps under bit path
; [2] Tool-length set: V-bit at sharp tip, end mill at flute bottom, drill at tip
; [3] WCS X0/Y0 at workpiece corner per VCarve Pro setup; Z0 = top of stock
; [4] Dust collection ON (set \`dustCollection: true\` to emit M7/M9, or
;     uncomment manually if your controller wires different M-codes)
; [5] Air-cut first: spindle off, Z high, 25–50% feed override
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Work area (mm): 1524 x 3048 x 203
; Spindle max: 24000 RPM
; Operation: cnc_adaptive
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
G21        ; G21=mm / G20=inch — must match controller defaults at power-on
G90              ; absolute distance mode
G17              ; XY plane (typical for G2/G3 arcs)
G94              ; feed in units/min
; Active work offset — verify fixture zero matches G54–G59 selection
G54
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Spindle on (dialect snippet — Mach3 emits M3 S<rpm>)
M3
G4 P2.0          ; dwell 2 s for spindle to reach commanded RPM (wood router warmup)
; M7              ; coolant/mist OFF — set dustCollection flag to emit M7 here
; M8              ; flood coolant — typically OFF for wood; uncomment for wet ops
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; [ID-0110] Pre-cut safe-Z lift -- mirrors carvera_3axis.hbs / carvera_4axis.hbs
; so the first XY/Z move below executes from a known clearance regardless of
; what Z the controller booted into or where the previous job left it.
G0 Z203 ; safe Z retract before toolpath -- uses machine work area Z height
; Adaptive clearing -- 8 inset level(s), 8 loop(s), 37 trochoid circle(s) per depth pass, stepover 1.500 mm, engagement cap 2.400 mm, wall stock 0.500 mm
; adaptive entry slot loop -- level 7 inset 11.000 mm (region core; fully buried entry pass)
